  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（今はこんな感じの服が流行ってるのか……\r\nせっかくだし、今後の参考にしていかないとな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "015"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　あそこにいるのは……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110010,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "──ありがとー\r\nそこそこに頑張りまぁす。ふふー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……あれー、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "なんでこんなところにいるんですかぁ？\r\nもしかしてー……私のストーカーですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、違うぞ\r\n仕事の合間にたまたまな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "はぁ\r\nそれで私を見つけて、のぞき見してたわけですねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひ、人聞きの悪いことを言うな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……というか、摩美々\r\n今ファンに話しかけられてたよな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですねー\r\nプロデューサーがのぞき見してたとおりです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……\r\nなんだか、楽しそうに話してたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そーですかねー……\r\n気のせいじゃないですかぁ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……さっきのファンの子が……\r\n私の服装、参考にしてるって言ってくれましたぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\n……良かったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうかしたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "別にー……\r\n…………",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あ、そうだぁ……さっきの子に\r\nサインしてあげたんですケドー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "最近、前より上手く書けるようになったと\r\n思うんですよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、そうか\r\nサインを書く機会もずいぶん増えたし、慣れたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々の成長を知れて、俺も嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……プロデューサーも、\r\n私がどれだけ成長したか、見たくないですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ\r\nもちろん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですかぁ……ふふー……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "な、なんだ？　その笑みは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……今日のプロデューサーはぁ、\r\n真っ白なシャツを着てますねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "サインのし甲斐がありそうですー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "私、サインペンって持ち歩くようにしてるんですよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "今日みたいに、いつサインを求められるか\r\nわからないですからねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ま、摩美々……？\r\n俺はこの後も大事な打ち合わせが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005005110190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "大丈夫ですよー\r\n私の宣伝にもなって、一石二鳥じゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500511/2005005110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "や、やめ……\r\nやめてくれーーーー！！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
